#: ../../extending/server-tools.rst:4
msgid "A server tool runs inside a model provider, unlike an ordinary ``AgentTool`` executed by the Agent loop. Install one provider-specific extension for each hosted capability you want to expose::"
msgstr "服务端工具运行在模型提供商内部，不像普通的 ``AgentTool``\\ 那样由 Agent 循环执行。想开放哪一项托管能力，就安装对应的提供商专属扩展::"

#: ../../extending/server-tools.rst:22
msgid "Every extension calls :meth:`~zett_agent.agent.AgentRunContext.register_server_tool` during ``on_tool``. The resulting definitions are request-scoped and reach every subsequent before-model hook and the final ``ModelRequest``. They never enter the Agent's local tool executor."
msgstr "每个扩展都会在 ``on_tool`` 期间调用 :meth:`~zett_agent.agent.AgentRunContext.register_server_tool`\\ 。由此得到的定义作用域限于本次请求，并会传递到其后每一个 before-model 钩子以及最终的 ``ModelRequest``\\ 。它们永远不会进入 Agent 的本地工具执行器。"

