#: ../../extending/server-tools.rst:56
msgid "OpenAIProvider, DeepSeekProvider and XAIProvider use Chat Completions by default. Construct any of them with ``response=True`` to use its Responses endpoint and enable its hosted tools explicitly::"
msgstr "OpenAIProvider、DeepSeekProvider 和 XAIProvider 默认使用 Chat Completions。用 ``response=True``\\ 构造其中任何一个，即可改用它的 Responses 端点，并显式启用其托管工具::"

#: ../../extending/server-tools.rst:66
msgid "The Responses adapter sends complete history on every request. It preserves provider output items for later function-result turns and maps hosted-tool start/completion records into the common server-tool event lifecycle. Available tool types still depend on the selected provider endpoint and model."
msgstr "Responses 适配器在每次请求时都会发送完整的历史记录。它会保留模型提供商的输出项，供之后的函数结果轮次使用，并把托管工具的启动/完成记录映射到通用的服务端工具事件生命周期中。可用的工具类型仍取决于所选的提供商端点与模型。"

#: ../../extending/server-tools.rst:71
msgid "OpenAI, DeepSeek and xAI publish no separate ``web_fetch`` type. Their hosted web-search workflow retrieves relevant pages itself. The defaults intentionally use documented types instead of sending an invented fetch discriminator."
msgstr "OpenAI、DeepSeek 和 xAI 没有单独发布 ``web_fetch``\\ 类型。它们托管的网页搜索工作流会自行抓取相关页面。默认值有意使用官方文档中的类型，而不是发送一个自造的 fetch 区分标识。"

#: ../../extending/server-tools.rst:76
msgid "Allow protocol evolution"
msgstr "允许协议演进"

#: ../../extending/server-tools.rst:78
msgid "Tool types are open strings and configurations are opaque mappings. New provider versions therefore do not require a zett-agent enum update::"
msgstr "工具类型是开放的字符串，配置则是不透明的映射。因此新的提供商版本不需要更新 zett-agent 的枚举::"

#: ../../extending/server-tools.rst:95
msgid "The provider remains responsible for model compatibility and field validation. Duplicate types in one request are rejected before network I/O because their ordering would otherwise make the active configuration ambiguous."
msgstr "模型兼容性和字段校验仍由提供商负责。同一次请求中出现重复的类型时，会在网络 I/O 之前就被拒绝，否则它们的顺序会让当前生效的配置变得有歧义。"

